      {"type":"Defense","label":"Target's morphed Toughness ignored (Mystic)","defense":"toughness","amount":"-@target.system.defenses.toughness.morphed","outgoing":true,"when":["target:morphed","not:target:status:armorStripped"]}
    ],
    "prerequisites": {"when":["self:type:npc"]},
    "automation": {
      "status": "partial",
      "notes": "<p>Automatic: your attacks ignore armor bonuses to Toughness and get ↑1 against targets that aren't Mystical, labelled Mystic in the Roll Options Dialog. A GM can mark any actor as Mystical or not.</p><p>Left to the table: leaving out attacks the stat block doesn't call Mystical.</p>"
